    "description": "Church, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Needs scaffolding: 20 tall (tower and spire; the nave roof is 11). Over budget: 1246 blocks vs 700 (first build 1094 vs 580). Stone parish church: a front bell tower with belfry openings and a dark oak spire, a rubble-stone nave with buttresses and lancets, a lower chancel with altar and choir stalls, a timber side porch; L2 the bell and its rope, a weathervane, stained glass, runner, font, pulpit, lanterns, banners and a churchyard; L3 carved pinnacles, a yew, flowers, vines, banners inside. The bell (L2) is not drawn by the Studio, only its chain. Not yet builder-tested: bell, blue_stained_glass_pane, candle, cauldron, cornflower, lectern, lightning_rod, red_stained_glass_pane, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_wall. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item.",
